flowchart TD
  Caller[User or future AI Orchestrator] --> API[Knowledge Retrieval API]
  API --> Identity[Verified identity and organization]
  Identity --> Core[Core: membership, permission, plugin policy]
  Core --> Local[Knowledge base/document grant policy]
  Local --> Scope[Authorized candidate SQL scope]
  API --> Embed[Compatible query embedding]
  Scope --> Search[PostgreSQL pgvector cosine search]
  Embed --> Search
  Search --> Ready[Active resources, current ready version only]
  Ready --> Ranked[Ranked authorized chunks]
  Ranked --> Citation[Knowledge-owned provenance and citation IDs]
  Citation --> Evidence[Evidence only: no LLM answer generation]
